158	   *
159	   * Closure dependencies (from renderOrchestrator() scope):
160	   *   `allChecksPassed`          — guards against starting when preflight has
161	   *                                not passed; mutated to false after a successful
162	   *                                launch so the button cannot be clicked twice.
163	   *   `refreshQueue`             — called immediately after a successful launch
164	   *                                to populate the queue with the new entry;
165	   *                                read-only (function reference).
166	   *   `renderPreflightResults`   — called when the server re-evaluates checks on
